# Files Claude delivers into the repo root. They are untracked by design, and
# without these lines a repo-wide `git clean -fd` deletes them along with any
# source data sitting beside them. It has happened once: v0.15's own tarball,
# the AT tax workbooks and app-concept.md all went in a single clean.
*.tar.gz
*.patch
*.bundle
# Source data kept beside the project, never committed but never disposable.
*.xlsx
app-concept.md

# Everything that is not the app. Delivered tarballs and patches, the source
# workbooks the datasets were generated from, and dead directories that can be
# looked at but not deleted from here.
_archive/
